viations, numbers, etc.\\n\\n## 8. src/extract/pdf_reader.py\\nModule to extract drug names from PDF files using Unstructured API:\\n- Function extract_from_pdf(filepath: Path, api_key: str, base_url: str = 'https://transform.unstructured.io')\n---\nThe checkpoint summary has been truncated due to hitting max length. Please see the conversation log file for the full conversation."}
